        "start_sec": 6.458,
        "end_sec": 15.047,
        "start_frame": 194,
        "end_frame": 451,
        "duration_frames": 257,
        "text": "When geopolitical stability fractures, the world turns to the one asset that has no counterparty risk, and 5,000 years of trust."
    },
    {
        "index": 4,
        "start_sec": 15.548,
        "end_sec": 20.013,
        "start_frame": 466,
        "end_frame": 600,
        "duration_frames": 134,
